      "source_unit_type": "outcome-reflection-summary",
      "text_projection": "线上面试\n⭕一面 （11：00开始面了大概一个小时）\n自我介绍\n先拷打校内专业课知识（计网的基础知识、数据结构的数据类型举例还有原理、排序算法举了6-7种还有实现原理、查找算法等)",
      "source_provenance": {
        "source_projection_ref": "liqiangcc/xhs:note_desc/672207f0000000001b013994.txt@95b77bb261048059846273688e4b90a2e108b437",
        "source_projection_sha256": "aac504c329d3f103b1176eb404004e096fec00f28a14c6b22229acb5af967b07",
        "raw_artifact_ref": "liqiangcc/xhs:note_detail/672207f0000000001b013994.html@95b77bb261048059846273688e4b90a2e108b437",
        "raw_sha256": "fd4686e2d4c301841f8d29d9da4e532ef10a7ef7b877c3090ed9743d8c9f243e",
        "source_projection_item_number": 1
      },
      "fragments": []
    },
    {
      "source_unit_id": "xhs:672207f0000000001b013994:snapshot-95b77bb26104:note-desc-8:u2",
      "position": 2,
      "source_unit_type": "outcome-reflection-summary",
      "text_projection": "然后大概问了Java八股的一些问题，包括JVM的内存划分及作用、堆内存的结构以及几种垃圾回收算法等，类的加载过程，Spring框架的原理，IOC、AOP、面向对象的理解和特征，问的都挺简单的）",
      "source_provenance": {
        "source_projection_ref": "liqiangcc/xhs:note_desc/672207f0000000001b013994.txt@95b77bb261048059846273688e4b90a2e108b437",
        "source_projection_sha256": "aac504c329d3f103b1176eb404004e096fec00f28a14c6b22229acb5af967b07",
        "raw_artifact_ref": "liqiangcc/xhs:note_detail/672207f0000000001b013994.html@95b77bb261048059846273688e4b90a2e108b437",
        "raw_sha256": "fd4686e2d4c301841f8d29d9da4e532ef10a7ef7b877c3090ed9743d8c9f243e",
        "source_projection_item_number": 2
      },
      "fragments": []
    },
    {
      "source_unit_id": "xhs:672207f0000000001b013994:snapshot-95b77bb26104:note-desc-8:u3",
      "position": 3,
      "source_unit_type": "narrative-summary",
      "text_projection": "紧接着就是这个笔试题回顾环节，答了图论➕DFS的一个解法，求单源最短路径，中间用一个flag处理特殊条件，跟自己当时写的代码思路复合就行",
      "source_provenance": {
        "source_projection_ref": "liqiangcc/xhs:note_desc/672207f0000000001b013994.txt@95b77bb261048059846273688e4b90a2e108b437",
        "source_projection_sha256": "aac504c329d3f103b1176eb404004e096fec00f28a14c6b22229acb5af967b07",
        "raw_artifact_ref": "liqiangcc/xhs:note_detail/672207f0000000001b013994.html@95b77bb261048059846273688e4b90a2e108b437",
        "raw_sha256": "fd4686e2d4c301841f8d29d9da4e532ef10a7ef7b877c3090ed9743d8c9f243e",
        "source_projection_item_number": 3
      },
      "fragments": []
    },
    {
      "source_unit_id": "xhs:672207f0000000001b013994:snapshot-95b77bb26104:note-desc-8:u4",
      "position": 4,
      "source_unit_type": "narrative-summary",
      "text_projection": "编程环节，做了一道类似于滑动窗口的题，给定字符串s和p，最少删除s中的几个字符才能使得p是s的子串。给你10-15分钟大概并讲解思路",
      "source_provenance": {
        "source_projection_ref": "liqiangcc/xhs:note_desc/672207f0000000001b013994.txt@95b77bb261048059846273688e4b90a2e108b437",
        "source_projection_sha256": "aac504c329d3f103b1176eb404004e096fec00f28a14c6b22229acb5af967b07",
        "raw_artifact_ref": "liqiangcc/xhs:note_detail/672207f0000000001b013994.html@95b77bb261048059846273688e4b90a2e108b437",
        "raw_sha256": "fd4686e2d4c301841f8d29d9da4e532ef10a7ef7b877c3090ed9743d8c9f243e",
        "source_projection_item_number": 4
      },
      "fragments": []
    },
    {
      "source_unit_id": "xhs:672207f0000000001b013994:snapshot-95b77bb26104:note-desc-8:u5",
      "position": 5,
      "source_unit_type": "question-like",
      "text_projection": "⭕二面（14：00开始面了40分钟）\n自我介绍\n拷打简历的项目经历，介绍整个项目细节，\n从项目引出其他知识点，问了Linux会不会用，问了一些命令包括使用的一些经历啥的。还有MySQL和Redis，询问两者之间的不同。平常咋用的。\n全程项目问的比较多，然后引出其他的。\n说我动手能力很强。",
      "source_provenance": {
        "source_projection_ref": "liqiangcc/xhs:note_desc/672207f0000000001b013994.txt@95b77bb261048059846273688e4b90a2e108b437",
        "source_projection_sha256": "aac504c329d3f103b1176eb404004e096fec00f28a14c6b22229acb5af967b07",
        "raw_artifact_ref": "liqiangcc/xhs:note_detail/672207f0000000001b013994.html@95b77bb261048059846273688e4b90a2e108b437",
        "raw_sha256": "fd4686e2d4c301841f8d29d9da4e532ef10a7ef7b877c3090ed9743d8c9f243e",
        "source_projection_item_number": 5
      },
      "fragments": []
    },
    {
      "source_unit_id": "xhs:672207f0000000001b013994:snapshot-95b77bb26104:note-desc-8:u6",
      "position": 6,
      "source_unit_type": "narrative-summary",
      "text_projection": "然后就是编程题，写了一题面试官子串的。\n输入一个任意字符串，写一个校验该字符串是否符合ipv4的规则。10-15分钟",
      "source_provenance": {
        "source_projection_ref": "liqiangcc/xhs:note_desc/672207f0000000001b013994.txt@95b77bb261048059846273688e4b90a2e108b437",
        "source_projection_sha256": "aac504c329d3f103b1176eb404004e096fec00f28a14c6b22229acb5af967b07",
        "raw_artifact_ref": "liqiangcc/xhs:note_detail/672207f0000000001b013994.html@95b77bb261048059846273688e4b90a2e108b437",
        "raw_sha256": "fd4686e2d4c301841f8d29d9da4e532ef10a7ef7b877c3090ed9743d8c9f243e",
        "source_projection_item_number": 6
      },
      "fragments": []
    },
    {
      "source_unit_id": "xhs:672207f0000000001b013994:snapshot-95b77bb26104:note-desc-8:u7",
      "position": 7,
      "source_unit_type": "question-like",
      "text_projection": "⭕三面主管面（15：00-15：30）\n自我介绍\n介绍了在校经历，实习经历等\n主要询问实习经历过程中的事情。\n问有没有遇到什么难点，这个我选择方案的时候\n被主管批评了，说目前业内对于该问题有了更好的解决方案（我是真没查到过，可能比较菜）\n然后介绍一下对于华为的文化包括加班的这个理解\n结合自身经历做了回答，还行。",
      "source_provenance": {
        "source_projection_ref": "liqiangcc/xhs:note_desc/672207f0000000001b013994.txt@95b77bb261048059846273688e4b90a2e108b437",
        "source_projection_sha256": "aac504c329d3f103b1176eb404004e096fec00f28a14c6b22229acb5af967b07",
        "raw_artifact_ref": "liqiangcc/xhs:note_detail/672207f0000000001b013994.html@95b77bb261048059846273688e4b90a2e108b437",
        "raw_sha256": "fd4686e2d4c301841f8d29d9da4e532ef10a7ef7b877c3090ed9743d8c9f243e",
        "source_projection_item_number": 7
